  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support- Q&#xeb;ndresa Qytetare/Civic Resistance - Core Support Civic Resistance/Q&#xeb;ndresa Qytetare</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d- Q&#xeb;ndresa Qytetare/Civic Resistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strategic Plan of Civic Resistance/Q&#xeb;ndresa Qytetare has five strategic objectives: 

Strategic Objective 1 - Promotion of Improved Educational Services
Strategic Objective 2 - Encouraging the participation of citizens in democratic processes
Strategic Objective 3 - Strengthening Institutional Capacity via Good Governance 
Strategic Objective 4 - Networking and Collaboration
Strategic Objective 5 - Partnership for Environmental Sustainability</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbetet &#xe4;r ett icke &#xf6;ronm&#xe4;rkt st&#xf6;d till Civic Resistance/ CR/Q&#xeb;ndresa Qytetare och baseras p&#xe5; partnerns strategiska plan 2024-2027. Genom att st&#xe4;rka ungdomars kapacitet, vilket &#xe4;r ett av huvudm&#xe5;len i den strategiska planen, avser partnern att fungera som en vakthund f&#xf6;r offentliga utgifter till universitet och bli en kritisk r&#xf6;st f&#xf6;r ungdomar n&#xe4;r det g&#xe4;ller utmaningar inom h&#xf6;gre utbildning i Albanien. Initiativ inom ramen f&#xf6;r den strategiska planen f&#xf6;r CR inkluderar &#xf6;vervakning av nationella strategier och resultat f&#xf6;r institutioner p&#xe5; central och lokal niv&#xe5;, organisation av utbildningsakademier f&#xf6;r val, r&#xe4;ttvisa och medborgarnas deltagande i beslutsfattande, framst&#xe4;llningar, kreativa former av protester och medborgarengagemang, kapacitetsuppbyggnad av unga ledare, etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cooperation is un-earmarked support to Civic Resistance/ CR/Q&#xeb;ndresa Qytetare and is based on the partner&#x2019;s Strategic Plan 2024-2027. Through strengthening the capacities of young people, which is one of the main goals of the strategic plan, the partner intend to act as a watchdog to public spending to universities and become a critical voice of the youth concerning higher education challenges in Albania. Initiatives under the Strategic Plan of CR include various monitoring of national strategies and performance for institutions at central and local level, organization of education academies on election, justice, and citizens participation in decision making, petitions, creative forms of protest and citizen&#x2019;s engagement, capacity building of young leaders, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
